<#eb2828>SERIOUS</>
Serious Stock		^X
  The bar at the bottom of the screen holds 3 stocks. It fills
  when he deals or takes damage, and slowly over time.
  X arms one stock (he flashes red). His next special or super
  is Serious: 30% more damage, and he walks through hits with
  half damage (throws still work).

<#eb2828>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves him
  open.
Grab		^Y
  Close, unblockable punch that knocks down.
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on him passes 15% of his life.
Dash / Back Step		_F_F / _B_B

<#eb2828>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
  Chains on hit only: Light into Medium into Heavy,
  standing into crouching. Blocked normals leave him at -8.
Forward Medium / Forward Heavy		_F^B / _F^C
Crouching Light / Medium / Heavy		_D^A / _D^B / _D^C
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C

<#eb2828>SPECIALS</>
Punch Blast		_D_DF_F^A / ^B
Punch Blast (anti-air)		_D_DF_F^C
Air Punch Blast		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C (air)
Normal Punches (ground/air)		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
  Tap any attack button to keep punching. Once per combo.
  With a Serious stock each punch does much more damage.
Teleport (forward / behind)		_D_D^A / _D_D^B

<#eb2828>SUPERS</>
Consecutive Normal Punches (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
  Any two of A / B / C.
Serious Consecutive Normal Punches (2 bars)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A_+^B
  Any two of A / B / C.
Serious Table Flip (2 bars)		_D_D^A_+^B
  Any two of A / B / C.
Serious Punch (3 bars)		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
